  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento de la red de atencin de la salud en Guyana</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Care Network Strengthening in Guyana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El objetivo del proyecto es mejorar la salud de la poblacin guyanesa a travs de un mayor acceso, calidad y eficiencia de los servicios de salud. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) mejorar los resultados de salud asociados con procedimientos de baja y alta complejidad, ampliando la capacidad de los hospitales estratgicos; (ii) ampliar la cobertura de los servicios de diagnstico, consulta mdica y gestin de pacientes, incluidos los pases del interior del pas, a travs de la salud digital (DH);</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The objective is to improve the health of the Guyanese population through increased access, quality, and efficiency of health services. Specific objectives are: (i) improve health outcomes associated with low and high complexity procedures, by expanding the capacity of strategic hospitals; (ii) extend coverage of diagnostic, medical consultation, and patient management services, inclusive of the countrys hinterlands, through digital health (DH); and (iii) increase the efficiency of the public health system, by strengthening key logistic, management, and support processes and inputs.</narrative>
  </description>
